{"text":"kuruntokai","n":243,"lines":["மானடி யன்ன கவட்டிலை அடும்பின்","தார்மணி யன்ன ஒண்பூக் கொழுதி","ஒண்தொடி மகளிர் வண்ட லயரும்","புள்ளிமிழ் பெருங்கடற் சேர்ப்பனை","உள்ளேன் தோழி படீஇயர்என் கண்ணே"],"tr":["māṉaṭi yaṉṉa kavaṭṭilai aṭumpiṉ","tārmaṇi yaṉṉa oṇpūk koḻuti","oṇtoṭi makaḷir vaṇṭa layarum","puḷḷimiḻ peruṅkaṭaṟ cērppaṉai","uḷḷēṉ tōḻi paṭīiyareṉ kaṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"நம்பி குட்டுவனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Nampi Kuṭṭuvaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 9, āciriyattaḷai 9"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மானடி","tr":"māṉaṭi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னடி","tr":"ṉaṭi"}]},{"text":"யன்ன","tr":"yaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"கவட்டிலை","tr":"kavaṭṭilai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவட்","tr":"kavaṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிலை","tr":"ṭilai"}]},{"text":"அடும்பின்","tr":"aṭumpiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அடும்","tr":"aṭum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]}],[{"text":"தார்மணி","tr":"tārmaṇi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தார்","tr":"tār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணி","tr":"maṇi"}]},{"text":"யன்ன","tr":"yaṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யன்","tr":"yaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"ஒண்பூக்","tr":"oṇpūk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒண்","tr":"oṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூக்","tr":"pūk"}]},{"text":"கொழுதி","tr":"koḻuti","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொழு","tr":"koḻu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]}],[{"text":"ஒண்தொடி","tr":"oṇtoṭi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒண்","tr":"oṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொடி","tr":"toṭi"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]},{"text":"வண்ட","tr":"vaṇṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வண்","tr":"vaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"லயரும்","tr":"layarum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"லய","tr":"laya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]}],[{"text":"புள்ளிமிழ்","tr":"puḷḷimiḻ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புள்","tr":"puḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிமிழ்","tr":"ḷimiḻ"}]},{"text":"பெருங்கடற்","tr":"peruṅkaṭaṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருங்","tr":"peruṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடற்","tr":"kaṭaṟ"}]},{"text":"சேர்ப்பனை","tr":"cērppaṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சேர்ப்","tr":"cērp"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பனை","tr":"paṉai"}]}],[{"text":"உள்ளேன்","tr":"uḷḷēṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உள்","tr":"uḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளேன்","tr":"ḷēṉ"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"படீஇயர்என்","tr":"paṭīiyareṉ","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படீ","tr":"paṭī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இயர்","tr":"iyar"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மானடி","parts":[{"text":"மான்","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"deer"},{"text":"அடி","lemma":"அடி","gloss":"foot"}],"gloss":"deer's hoof"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"கவட்டிலை","parts":[{"text":"கவட்டிலை","lemma":"கவட்டிலை","gloss":"cleft leaf"}],"gloss":"cleft leaf","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அடும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"அடும்பு","lemma":"அடும்பு","gloss":"adumbu creeper"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the adumbu creeper"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தார்மணி","parts":[{"text":"தார்","lemma":"தார்","gloss":"harness garland"},{"text":"மணி","lemma":"மணி","gloss":"bell"}],"gloss":"harness bell"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"ஒண்பூ","parts":[{"text":"ஒண்பூ","lemma":"ஒண்பூ","gloss":"bright flower"}],"gloss":"bright flower","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொழுதி","parts":[{"text":"கொழுதி","lemma":"கொழுதி","gloss":"plucking"}],"gloss":"plucking"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒண்தொடி","parts":[{"text":"ஒண்தொடி","lemma":"ஒண்தொடி","gloss":"bright bangles"}],"gloss":"bright bangles","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"வண்டல்","parts":[{"text":"வண்டல்","lemma":"வண்டல்","gloss":"sandplay"}],"gloss":"sandplay"},{"surface":"அயரும்","parts":[{"text":"அயரும்","lemma":"அயர்தல்","gloss":"playing"}],"gloss":"playing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புள்ளிமிழ்","parts":[{"text":"புள்","lemma":"புள்","gloss":"bird"},{"text":"இமிழ்","lemma":"இமிழ்தல்","gloss":"sounding"}],"gloss":"birds chirping"},{"surface":"பெருங்கடல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"},{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"கடல்","gloss":"sea"}],"gloss":"great sea"},{"surface":"சேர்ப்பனை","parts":[{"text":"சேர்ப்பன்","lemma":"சேர்ப்பன்","gloss":"lord of the shore"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative"}],"gloss":"the lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உள்ளேன்","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளேன்","lemma":"உள்ளேன்","gloss":"I will not think of"}],"gloss":"I will not think of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"படீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"படீஇயர்","lemma":"படீஇயர்","gloss":"let them close"}],"gloss":"let them close","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eyes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"eyes"}]}],"literal":"Deer's hoof like cleft-leaved adumbu's / harness-bell like bright flowers plucking, / bright-bangle-wearing girls play with sand-castles, / on the bird-resounding great sea's shore-lord, / I will not think of, my friend, so that my eyes may sleep!","translation":"I will not think of him, my friend—the lord of the great sea-shore where birds chirp, and where girls wearing bright bangles pluck the bright flowers, shaped like harness bells, of the cleft-leaved adumbu creeper that resembles a deer's hoof, to play in their sand-castles. I will not think of him, so that my eyes may finally close in sleep.","modern":"மான் குளம்பு போன்ற பிளந்த இலைகளைக் கொண்ட அடும்புக் கொடியின், குதிரை மாலையின் மணி போன்ற ஒளிரும் பூக்களைக் கொய்து, ஒளிரும் வளையல்களை அணிந்த பெண்கள் வண்டல் விளையாட்டு விளையாடும், பறவைகள் ஒலிக்கும் பெரிய கடற்கரைத் தலைவனை, தோழியே! நான் நினைக்க மாட்டேன்; என் கண்கள் உறங்கட்டும்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in a state of deep distress caused by the hero's absence. She is unable to sleep because her mind is constantly filled with thoughts of him. In her frustration, she declares that she will stop thinking about the lord of the shore so that her eyes can finally find rest. This poem belongs to the Neytal (maritime) landscape, characterized by coastal elements like the adumbu creeper, chirping sea-birds, and girls playing in the sand. The imagery of the girls plucking bell-like flowers to play happily contrasts with the heroine's sleepless grief. Key words include adumbu (the coastal creeper), vaṇṭal (sandplay), and uḷḷēṉ (I will not think of).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.77,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.5],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.27],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,4.6],[4.6,5.0],[5.0,5.07],[5.07,5.6],[5.6,6.2],[6.2,6.7],[6.7,6.7],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,7.3],[7.3,7.6],[7.6,7.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.97,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.3],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,5.7],[5.7,5.7],[5.7,5.8],[5.8,6.4],[6.4,6.6],[6.6,7.03],[7.03,7.1],[7.1,8.7],[8.7,8.7],[8.7,9.0],[9.0,9.3],[9.3,9.6],[9.6,9.9]]}}